<body>
    <h1>Polarion Login Issues</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><span>When a user is not able to login to Polarion Production Se=
rver, a QuickService ticket for Login Issues is created by them. Below are =
the scenarios that can cause Login Issues for End Users:</span><span>&nbsp;=
</span></p>
<p><strong><span>=E2=80=AFPre-Requisites to be checked by AO Team:</span></=
strong><span>&nbsp;</span></p>
<ol>
 <li><span>User should be present in Polarion</span><span>&nbsp;</span></li=
>
 <li><span>User should be present in FME AD with entry in the =E2=80=98cn=
=E2=80=99 field=3D &lt;user FID&gt; or &lt;username&gt;</span><span>&nbsp;<=
/span></li>
 <li><span>User should be member of Polarion Group &lt;</span><strong><span=
>GG-DE-SCW-Polarion-ALM-Users</span></strong><span>&gt;</span><span>&nbsp;<=
/span></li>
</ol>
<p><u><strong>Scenario-1 </strong><strong>The user is not present in Polari=
on, Polarion Group but present in FME AD:=E2=80=AF</strong>&nbsp;</u></p>
<ul>
 <li><span>Search the user in Polarion, </span><span>and in Polarion Group =
&lt;</span><strong><span>GG-DE-SCW-Polarion-ALM-Users</span></strong><span>=
&gt;</span><span>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
 <li><span>If the user is not found, AO support will raise an IT Schweinfur=
t request for new user creation </span><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"h=
ttps://jira-ext.fmc-ag.com/plugins/servlet/desk/site/fme-portals/user/reque=
sts?status=3Dopen&amp;reporter=3Dme" rel=3D"nofollow"><span>User Creation i=
n Polarion</span></a><span> and ask the user to create UACF request to get =
the required roles in the projects using below mentioned link- </span><a cl=
ass=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://qservice.intra.fresenius.com/serviced=
esk/customer/portal/17/create/283" rel=3D"nofollow"><span>UACF request</spa=
n></a><span>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<p><u><strong>Scenario-2 </strong><strong>User is not present in FME AD but=
 present in Polarion:</strong></u></p>
<ul>
 <li><span>If the user is not available in the FME AD, AO support will rais=
e a request with Global DTI (<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"mailto:Marv=
in.Heynen@freseniusmedicalcare.com" rel=3D"nofollow">Marvin.Heynen@freseniu=
smedicalcare.com</a>) to get the user added to the Active Directory.</span>=
<span>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
 <li><span>Once the user is added to the AD, AO support check if the user i=
s part of Polarion Group. If the user is not part of the group, AO support =
will raise an IT Schweinfurt request for new user creation </span><a class=
=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://jira-ext.fmc-ag.com/plugins/servlet/desk=
/site/fme-portals/user/requests?status=3Dopen&amp;reporter=3Dme" rel=3D"nof=
ollow"><span>User Creation in Polarion</span></a>.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
 <li><span>Once the user is setup</span><span>, execute a LDAP user sync jo=
b and confirm that new user is created in Polarion with ID equal to value o=
f =E2=80=9CsAMAccountName=E2=80=9D attribute in AD, then </span><span>AO su=
pport will ask the user to login to Polarion.</span><span>&nbsp;</span></li=
>
</ul>
<p><u><strong>Scenario-3</strong>&nbsp;<strong>User is present in the Polar=
ion with FID, FME AD (with cn=3D&lt;FID&gt;) but not in the Polarion Group:=
 </strong>&nbsp;</u></p>
<ul>
 <li><span>If the user is not part of the Polarion Group, AO support will r=
aise an IT Schweinfurt request for new user creation </span><a class=3D"ext=
ernal-link" href=3D"https://jira-ext.fmc-ag.com/plugins/servlet/desk/site/f=
me-portals/user/requests?status=3Dopen&amp;reporter=3Dme" rel=3D"nofollow">=
<span>User Creation in Polarion</span></a>.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
 <li><span>Once the user is setup, </span><span>execute a LDAP user sync jo=
b and confirm that new user is created in Polarion with ID equal to value o=
f =E2=80=9CsAMAccountName=E2=80=9D attribute in AD, then </span><span>AO su=
pport will ask the user to login to Polarion.</span><span>&nbsp;</span></li=
>
</ul>
<p><u><strong>Scenario-4</strong>&nbsp;<strong>User is present in Polarion =
with FID and in the FME AD with =E2=80=98cn=E2=80=99 value=3D &lt;username&=
gt;:</strong></u></p>
<ul>
 <li><span>AO support will check if the user is a member of the Polarion Gr=
oup (check for &lt;</span><strong><span> GG-DE-SCW-Polarion-ALM-Users</span=
></strong><span> &gt; in the =E2=80=98memberOf=E2=80=99 attribute in AD). I=
f the user is not a member of the group, AO will raise an IT Schweinfurt re=
quest for new user creation </span><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https=
://jira-ext.fmc-ag.com/plugins/servlet/desk/site/fme-portals/user/requests?=
status=3Dopen&amp;reporter=3Dme" rel=3D"nofollow"><span>User Creation in Po=
larion</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
 <li><span>Once the user is added, </span><span>(and user sync job is execu=
ted in Polarion)</span><span> they will be available in Polarion with two e=
ntries. One with FID and a new one with &lt;user name&gt;.&nbsp;</span><spa=
n>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
 <li><span>In this scenario, to retain the history of the user, AO support =
needs to map the new account&lt; username &gt; to the existing account &lt;=
FID&gt;.</span><span>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
 <li><span>Steps to set this up are as below:</span><span>&nbsp;</span></li=
>
</ul>
<ol>
 <li><span>Login to Polarion as a Global Administrator</span><span>&nbsp;</=
span></li>
 <li><span>Open </span><strong><span>Users</span></strong><span> section an=
d search for the user. (Two entries will be found for the affected user)</s=
pan><span>&nbsp;</span></li>
 <li><span>Click on =E2=80=9C</span><strong><span>Login ID Configuration</s=
pan></strong><span>=E2=80=9D and set &lt;user userId=3D&lt;FID&gt; loginId=
=3D&lt;UserName&gt; /&gt;</span><span>&nbsp;</span></li>
 <li><span>Click on <strong>Users</strong> and <strong>Delete</strong> the =
user entry with &lt;Username&gt;<strong>Users</strong> and <strong>Delete</=
strong> the user entry with &lt;Username&gt;</span></li>
</ol>
<p><strong style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbs=
p; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;=
">&nbsp;<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded=
-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" =
width=3D"350" src=3D"0b5d52e0430d8205916ea27a243dc1c7006103eb05f8f387f6ad13=
705868fd1a" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/248252052/image-2024-9-=
30_16-13-9.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1727694801219&amp;api=3Dv=
2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"248252030=
" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachmen=
t" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2024-9-30_16-13-9.png" data-=
base-url=3D"https://bluespace.fmeone.com" data-linked-resource-content-type=
=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"248252052" data-linked-=
resource-container-version=3D"6" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" height=3D"233"></s=
pan></span></p>
<p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.=
0px;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5. Click on </span><span style=3D"letter-s=
pacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;Save.</span></span></p>
<p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;6. Onc=
e the user is setup, AO support will ask the user to login to Polarion.</sp=
an><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><u><strong>Scenario-5</strong> <strong style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">=
User is present in the Polarion ,FME AD and Polarion Group: </strong><span =
style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;</span></u></p>
<ul>
 <li><span>If the user is present in the Polarion ,FME AD and Polarion Grou=
p but not able to login to Polarion, AO support will ask the user to update=
 the password using <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://adfs5.fresen=
ius.com/adfs/portal/updatepassword" rel=3D"nofollow">https://adfs5.freseniu=
s.com/adfs/portal/updatepassword</a></span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
 <li><span>If the user is not able to update password AO support will reach=
 out to the </span><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"mailto:globalDTIservi=
cedesk@freseniusmedicalcare.com" rel=3D"nofollow"><span>Global DTI ServiceD=
esk</span></a><span> for password reset.</span><span>&nbsp;<br></span><span=
>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<p><u><strong>Scenario-6 </strong><strong>Inactive FID Account:</strong></u=
></p>
<ul>
 <li><span>If the user is able to update his password but not able to login=
 to Polarion, AO support </span><span>will reach out to Michael Baunach to<=
/span><span> check the status of user FID account, if the user=E2=80=99s FI=
D account is inactive then AO support will provide </span><a class=3D"exter=
nal-link" href=3D"https://fnc.service-now.com/esc?id=3Dsc_cat_item&amp;sys_=
id=3Dc479c5bbdbb87d509b815117f396198d" rel=3D"nofollow"><span>FID Reactivat=
ion Link</span></a><span> to the user.</span><span>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
 <li><span>Once account is reactivated, AO support will ask the user to log=
in to Polarion.=E2=80=AF</span><span>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><spa=
n>&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><u><strong>Scenario-7 </strong><strong style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">=
Duplicate entry in AD:</strong></u></p>
<ul>
 <li><span>If user has two AD accounts:</span><span>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; one AD account with </span><str=
ong><span>&lt; CN: =E2=80=9CFID=E2=80=9D&gt; &lt;</span></strong><strong><s=
pan> </span></strong><strong><span>sAMAccountName : fid&gt;</span></strong>=
<span> and another AD account with </span><strong><span>&lt; CN: =E2=80=9Cn=
ame=E2=80=9D&gt;, &lt; sAMAccountName : firstname.lastname&gt;</span></stro=
ng><span>.</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Example:</span><span> </span></p=
>
<p><strong style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbs=
p;1. &lt; CN: =E2=80=9CFID=E2=80=9D&gt; &lt; sAMAccountName : fid&gt;</span=
></strong><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=3D"confluence-embedd=
ed-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-e=
